 for the quarter ended September 30, 2023, Rs. 14.92 million for the quarter ended December 31, 2022 and Rs. 19.86 million for year ended March 31, 2023, respectively representing the revenues relating to lab setup services provided under SCA, the costs of fulfilling the contract and the right to charge the customer for the services to be rendered, respectively.   6. Pursuant to ' Vimta Labs Employee Stock Option Plan 2021 (VLESOP-2021)', during the quarter ended and Nine months ended December 31,2023 , the company has allotted 18,018 Equity shares of Rs. 2 each and 36,376 Equity shares of Rs. 2 each upon exercise of Employee stock options by the eligible employees. Accordingly, the paid up share capital of the company stands increased from Rs.44.26 million to Rs.44.33 million for the period ended 31st March,2023 to 31st December,2023 respectively.   In respect of stock options granted pursuant to the Company���s stock options plan, the fair value of the options is accounted as employee compensation expense over the vesting period. Consequently, the amount of employee benefits expense includes Rs.3.04 million for the quarter ended December 31,2023, Rs.4.10 million for the quarter ended September 30,2023, Rs.9.37 million for the quarter ended December 31,2022 and Rs.40.74 million for year ended March 31, 2023 respectively.   7.The previous period figures have been regrouped/rearranged wherever necessary to make it comparable with the current period.", "re_desc_note_seg": "-", "re_dil_eps_bfr_exi": null, "re_dilut_eps_for_cont_dic_opr": "4.2", "re_diluted_eps": null, "re_excepn_items": null, "re_excepn_items_new": "0", "re_extraord_items": null, "re_face_val": "2", "re_face_value_debt": null, "re_from_dt": "01-OCT-2023", "re_goi_per_shhd": null, "re_grs_npa": null, "re_grs_npa_per": null, "re_inc_dre_sttr": "1.5", "re_income_inv": null, "re_int_dis_adv_bills": null, "re_int_earned": null, "re_int_expd": null, "re_int_new": "53.2", "re_int_ser_cov": null, "re_minority_